	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"text"},
		line=894,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010030c"},
		line=894,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"After school, I visit our headquarters to retrieve the spellblades that need Honing.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"When I enter the arsenal through its multiple layers of locked doors, I'm greeted by all the spellblades we've collected so far.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Heya, girls. Long time no see.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"I take a deep breath in and fill my lungs with the smell of blade-sharpening clove oil.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Ah, how relaxing...",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"I hope that when death comes for me, they might cover my body with this oil and set me on fire.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ahh, what a rough day at school.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kotone definitely hates me now... What should I even do?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The spellblades don't have an answer for me. Obviously.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"But I don't feel lonely because, even though they can't talk, I believe each spellblade has its own distinct personality.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Whenever I hold them, I can get a vague idea of how\nthey're doing today and how they want to be handled.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Spellblades only come into being when one or more priestesses offer their very lives to forge them.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Turning their own souls unto spellforce, they infuse their wills into the vessel of the blade.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"So it's not strange at all that these blades have their own personalities.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Rather, it'd be strange if they didn't.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"When I have the time, I'd love to chat with every last spellblade in our arsenal, but I am unfortunately not at liberty to do that today.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I grab only the blade we're going to have Kotone Hone.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, you poor girl. They've treated you so roughly.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Her sheath is missing, and her body bears several cruel burn scars.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Damaged to this extent, this blade is beyond the abilities of the Sworn Blades' own priestesses to Hone.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"But the Exalt-Priestess can surely manage it.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah, but she totally hates me.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Ooh, if only I was better at talking to people.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"I looked it up later, and apparently ≪sword≫ is how they say “blade” in Republican.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"She was just trying to lighten the mood with a joke.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ahh, I ruined everything! Why didn't I realize what she was doing?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How could I have been so oblivious?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Dejectedly, I wrap the burned spellblade in cloth.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Suddenly, I hear a voice call out to me.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"It's a delicate, fragile voice, like the silently sorrowful sobbing of a woman cruelly cast aside by her man.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Perhaps it lacerates my heart so much because I find myself in a similar situation?",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"As I search for the source of that voice, I come across a spellblade of cloudless azure.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"The blade raises a voice of displeasure, as though she can hear my own thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(There, there, don't cry now.)”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"I still have about thirty minutes to spare.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"I can at least afford to give her a little maintenance.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"With my mind made up, I take the blade into my hands.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"After my shift, I take the shop van over to the Imperial Temple with Akari and Hotori in tow.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"As soon as we get out, a priestess waiting at the gates bows to us.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"She's the attendant I met at the office this morning.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Office Priestess"},
			{
"“Tokita-sama, I presume?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Office Priestess"},
			{
"“Her Eminence the Exalt-Priestess has instructed me to guide you to her.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"She bows courteously.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please, lead the way.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Lead the way.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“After you.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Akari says with a bow.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"I brought her along on the condition that she stays out of the way.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Office Priestess"},
			{
"“This way, if you please.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"We follow the priestess's lead.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"I thought we'd be heading to the main worship hall, but that doesn't turn out to be the case.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"We enter the building through the temple office and proceed deeper and deeper.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Considering that we descended a flight of stairs at one point, we might very well be underground.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"The space we arrive in is not particularly large.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"On the altar facing us, a gilt bronze mirror representing Oomikami shimmers with a cool light.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Standing before this ostensibly inanimate mirror, I somehow feel as though I'm being watched by a higher power.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Perhaps I am actually standing before Oomikami Himself across the mirror.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Welcome. May Oomikami's grace be upon you.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Kotone greets us in front of the altar. She is flanked by ten attending priestesses, five on each side.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shall be fine on my own from here.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"With these words from Kotone, all the attending priestesses bow and silently withdraw.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"The priestess who guided us here is also nowhere to be seen.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"To offer her prayers in the inner sanctum of the Imperial Temple with ten priestesses waiting on her.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Such is the station of the Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Combined with the room's dignified atmosphere, it makes Kotone appear like an entirely different person.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My sincerest apologies for being unable to receive you personally, but I am afraid the temple has many customs not easily breached.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Looks like we should consider it an honor that you granted us an audience in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Perish the thought! All this pomp and circumstance is nothing but stifling.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I simply cannot get used to people bowing to me.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Kotone murmurs with a self-deprecating smile.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Now then, may I please examine the blade in question?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shall take a look.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"The blade we've brought Kotone is one that all of our priestesses claimed was beyond their abilities to Hone.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Likely dug up from the burned ruins of the Warrior District,\nit's charred pitch-black and covered in splinters and scratches.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"The blade's jewel, containing its spellforce, is murky and nearly opaque.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"It would be hard to even recognize it as having once been a proper blade.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How cruelly you have been treated...”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"As Kotone cradles the blade in her hands, it responds to her reverence by emanating a faint glow.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Kotone closes her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This blade was forged around five centuries and three score years ago.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Its inscription is ",
{"ruby", text="Ripple"},
"Sazanami",
{"/ruby"},
". It contains the soul of one priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This blade empowers its wielder to commune with nature in modest ways.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Kotone speaks quietly, as though translating the light radiating from the blade into human language.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"About 560 years ago, a priestess offered her life to create Sazanami.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Perhaps its communion with nature was to be used for locating enemies lurking on the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"For generations, our ancestors sallied forth unto battle with this blade in hand, listening ever closely to the voice of nature.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"A nature that vanished without a trace beneath the shadow of the Republic's firebombs.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(She can tell that much just from holding it?)”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(It would normally take a priestess nearly two hours.\nKotone's power is on a totally different level.)”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(She's actually pretty amazing, isn't she?)”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shall proceed with the Honing.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Kotone withdraws a sheet of rice paper from her kimono.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"She delicately folds it in two over the body of the blade.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Terrible mighty Oomikami, Thy humble servant beseeches Thee. Bestow of me Thy powers Lordly...”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Kotone begins chanting her invocation.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"It is not the low, rumbling tone of the manager's.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The string of sounds, barely recognizable as a voice, envelops Kotone's body and expands outwards.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kghh...”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"I feel an inexplicable sense of pressure.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"There isn't so much as a breeze, yet a force that threatens to crush my body closes in from all sides.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"It is as though the overflowing will of Oomikami is trying to expurgate our impure presence from His sacred hall of worship.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"The blade emits a dazzling radiance.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Kotone draws the blade across the paper, as if to wipe the rust clean from its body.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"As it effortlessly passes through the paper, not so much as a blemish remains.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"At the same time, the jewel in its hilt recovers its brilliant luster.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"To think that it was so horribly damaged just seconds ago...",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Amazing...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Forgetting the force assaulting my body, I stare on in dumbstruck awe.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Kotone finishes wiping the blade up to its very tip.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"She exhales a long, thin breath.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"With that, the light enveloping the blade scatters like countless fireflies.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The Honing... is complete.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Kotone cradles the blade in her arms once again.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well done.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That was amazing!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Excellent work!”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"The three of us raise our voices.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Before you offer your compliments, please appraise the results.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Kotone returns the blade to its wrappings and stands up.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"At a glance, her brow is damp with sweat.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Even for the Exalt-Priestess, the use of such magicks is physically draining.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Allow me to inspect it.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Hotori examines the blade.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Even a cursory glance speaks to the overwhelming quality of the Honing.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Rude as it is to say, it's on a completely different level from anything our priestesses could accomplish.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This is magnificent.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am glad it went well.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It would be terribly shameful if I failed here.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Kotone shows us an innocent smile.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This is the first time I've seen someone Hone a spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're amazing, Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Akari's voice overflows with wonderous adulation.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am still but a novice.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Such a task would have been a mere trifle for my predecessor.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Kotone says while humbly lowering her head.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, that's right. I had a question to ask you regarding spellblades.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But of course. Anything that is within my power to answer.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've always been taught that only warriors are capable of wielding spellblades, but are there exceptions?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah! I wanna hear about this too.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Exceptions... Exceptions, you ask?”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Kotone ponders the question for a while.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Spellblades invoke their power upon reacting to the bloodline of the Forefather, which only flows through the descendants of warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But if one had enough innate spellforce to overrule that edict, it may not be impossible.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Though that would be far beyond my abilities, at least.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Any thoughts?)”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Me? I don't know any magicks.)”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In the first place, however, I question whether someone with such powerful magicks would have any need of a spellblade.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It would be a trivial matter for them to dispatch most foes with the mere flick of a finger, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now that you mention it, that's a good point.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“For reference, would you be able to lay waste to an entire mountain?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Certainly not, sir!”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Someone like me could only manage but a single hill...”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"I genuinely can't tell whether this is her trying to be humble.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So you could destroy an entire hill, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, I suppose. I got in terrible trouble for it afterwards, though...”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“One might consider it a regrettable youthful indiscretion. Ahahahaha...”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"I'm not sure such a spontaneous act of landscaping qualifies as a “youthful indiscretion.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Your Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes?!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Hotori finally speaks up after being silent all this time.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I apologize. I got carried away with tales of my exploits.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's a trifling token, but...”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Hotori offers her a small silken parcel.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"She'd prepared it as payment for the Honing.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“P-Please, your sentiment is more than enough! Honing blades is the rite of every priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Likewise, we warriors have a longstanding tradition of delivering a token of gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's considered to be an offering to Oomikami for lending us His power.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I see. I was not aware.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Kotone claps her hands together.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Very well. I shall certainly accept your offering next time.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Next time?”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This time, I would boldly make a request of you instead.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Kotone adopts a humble expression.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Would you please escort me to the Warrior District?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There are only ruins left there.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, I am well aware.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am also aware that entry is strictly prohibited at present.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even so, by the powers vested in me as Exalt-Priestess, I wish to perform a memorial service for the warriors who lost their lives there.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is my understanding that countless numbers of the dead were never interred and left exposed to the elements.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Such a fate is simply too tragic...”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"The Warrior District was razed in the air raid which served as the harbinger of war.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"The dead number over thirty thousand, most of whom were warriors and their families.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Indeed, the victims of the Warrior District bombings comprise over eighty percent of all casualties suffered during the war.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"And yet, the warriors were treated as war criminals following the war, and no proper memorial services were ever held.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Since the passing of my predecessor, the station of Exalt-Priestess has been vacant, and nobody could perform a memorial service.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Now that I have taken up this mantle, I do not wish to neglect the souls of the dead a moment longer.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Your Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Hotori mutters, barely above a whisper.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I made the same request of the chancellor, but I was harshly rebuked.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No choice remains but for me to sneak in.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Hotori doesn't even try to conceal her tears.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"I reach out and stroke her trembling back.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? Umm... Inou-sama? Have I made yet another blunder?”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If the Exalt-Priestess, the supreme prelate of the Tento faith, is to perform a memorial service, the fallen warriors will surely find rest.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We cannot begin to express the depth of our gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"I bow in place of Hotori, who is still unable to speak through her tears.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Left exposed to the elements and spat on by the people of the Empire, the souls of the departed warriors may now finally rest in peace.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Even I, who lost all my memories of the war, can feel my chest tighten at the thought.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"How much stronger must Hotori's feelings be?",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"At the same time, however, I resent myself for being unable to share in her sorrow.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"My own family...",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"My adoptive parents... My sister... They should still be buried among those ruins, but their faces have already vanished beyond the veil of oblivion.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I swear I shall see you safely to the Warrior District.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you very much. I find myself once again in your debt.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Kotone gives us a deep bow.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Though we really ought to be the ones to lower our heads.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I feel truly fortunate to have met you.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You are far too gracious.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Me too... I can't thank you enough.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now my ancestors may finally rest in peace.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How fortunate we are to have you as our Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you very much, Inou-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Kotone's ears turn red at Hotori's benevolent, trusting gaze.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll go ahead and figure out a time and a plan of action.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can you tell us how to contact you?”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, but of course, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Kotone graces us with a joyful smile.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Good for you, Kotone. Inou wouldn't say that unless she really meant it.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed! Up until now, I was on pins and needles, wondering when she would cut me down...”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah?!”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Kotone nervously glances at Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hehehee.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"It's still a bit awkward, but Hotori manages to show her a relaxed expression.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Inou-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"This time, it's Kotone's turn to be overwhelmed with emotion and burst into tears.",
			},
		},
	},
